## User

Split a list into chunks of the given size; the last chunk may be shorter.

## Type

type
```haskell
chunksOf :: Int -> [a] -> [[a]]
```

## Term

```haskell
chunksOf n xs = go n xs
  where
    go _ [] = []
    go n (x:xs) = x : go (n - 1) xs
```

